  "intro": "If you're under the age of 40 you won't even remember many of these celebrity characters. Nevertheless, they all have their part to play in my life and my treasured memories of the past 50 years. Superstars in their own right they remain amongst the world's most treasured celebrities from comedy, film, music, sport and politics.",
