  "musicIntro": "Will these days ever be repeated. I grew up loving and admiring these people — they are part of my life. I still have my 'Walkman' from yesteryear and the majority of these music greats are included on the tracks. If you just love celebrating the 60's, 70's and 80's these 'mimic' songs will bring back loads of treasured memories for you from those eras.",
